<title>JAPAN: Mos Food to buy back up to 3.47 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Mos Food to buy back up to 3.47 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamburger chain operator Mos Food Services Inc said on Thursday that it plans to buy back up to 3.47 million of its own shares.  </p>
<p>The plan needs to be approved by a shareholders' meeting scheduled for June 27, Mos Food said.</p>
</text>
